Fix the organization view writing the post memberships onto the post
content object while rendering, which made plone.protect treat the page
view as an unsafe write and redirect to the confirm-action page. The
memberships are now resolved in the view (post_members) instead.

Adds functional view tests that render the default view of every
politikus.popolo content type, and installs politikus.bods in the test
layer so the views are tested as on a real site.
